WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.142
This is Game Plan.

00:00:01.142 --> 00:00:05.645
It is your plan, built around your life, not somebody else's rule book.

00:00:05.645 --> 00:00:10.846
It already knows your football and your gym sessions, so it never plans over them.

00:00:10.846 --> 00:00:15.603
It keeps an eye on what school has set, and tells you what is due and when.

00:00:15.603 --> 00:00:17.253
You choose when you study.

00:00:17.253 --> 00:00:20.995
The app only suggests, and you say yes, move it or swap it.

00:00:20.995 --> 00:00:23.596
Time online with your mates is protected.

00:00:23.596 --> 00:00:26.133
So is time with your mates face to face.

00:00:26.133 --> 00:00:32.032
Small wins earn you XP and build streaks, so you can see progress without anyone nagging you.

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:34.759
Every page has a short video like this one.

00:00:34.759 --> 00:00:38.501
Watch them when you want a hand, skip them when you do not.

00:00:38.501 --> 00:00:41.482
Right, open Today. That is your starting point.

